msgstr ""

msgctxt "#30163"
msgid "The theme in the root of each video source folder, played while browsing. Off: it never plays. A source with no root theme is treated the same as off."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "#30164"
msgid "When the root theme is off or not found, the global theme takes its place in the library: in lists, and in info, seasons and episodes that have no theme of their own. Needs the global theme to be on with a folder set."
msgstr ""

